<title>JAPAN: Nippon Light files shelf registration.</title>
<headline>Nippon Light files shelf registration.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nippon Light Metal Co Ltd said Wednesday that it had applied to the Finance Ministry for a shelf registration to issue up to 50 billion yen worth of corporate bonds.</p>
<p>The registration will be effective for two years from July 8, the major producer of aluminium said.</p>
